### Claude Desktop config
Install Node.js. Claude Desktop → Settings → Developer → Edit Config, paste, put your real token in place of YOUR_LONG_RANDOM_TOKEN in the file only, save, restart Claude Desktop.

```
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "harvest-lane": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["mcp-remote", "YOUR_MCP_PRODUCTION_URL",
               "--header", "Authorization: Bearer ${AUTH_TOKEN}"],
      "env": { "AUTH_TOKEN": "YOUR_LONG_RANDOM_TOKEN" }
    }
  }
}
```
Behind nginx: turn off proxy buffering (and gzip) for the /mcp path.
